Set x to 2. Switch x: When 1: Say "one". Break. When 2: Say "two". Break. Otherwise: Say "other". Break. End switch. Switch 3: When 1: Say "one". Break. When 3: Say "three". Break. Otherwise: Say "other". Break. End switch. Switch 1: When 1: Say "first". When 2: Say "second". Break. Otherwise: Say "other". Break. End switch. Switch 9: When 1: Say "one". Break. Otherwise: Say "missing". Break. End switch. Switch 9: Otherwise: Say "default first". Break. When 5: Say "five". Break. End switch. Switch 4: When 4: When 5: Say "five". Break. Otherwise: Say "other". Break. End switch. Switch 1: When 1: Switch 2: When 2: Say "inner". Break. Otherwise: Say "inner other". Break. End switch. Break. Otherwise: Say "outer other". Break. End switch. Set hits to 0. For n from 1 to 4: Switch n: When 3: Continue. Otherwise: Add 1 to hits. Break. End switch. End for. Say hits. Declare code as integer with value 7. Switch code: When 7: Say "seven". Break. Otherwise: Say "else". Break. End switch. Procedure classify takes value as long integer returns long integer: Set result to 0. Switch value: When 1: Set result to 10. Break. When 2: Set result to 20. Break. Otherwise: Set result to 0. Break. End switch. Return result. End procedure. Say Call classify with 2 done. Say Call classify with 9 done.
